{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sarI0UYCkE1792717047.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國SK海力士據報因股東及監管機構反對，放棄分拆Solidigm上市的計劃。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述監管機構文件指，生產快閃記憶體的Solidigm已暫停推進上市前期融資流程。公司聲明指，鑑於近期資本市場狀況，以及股價走勢，目前需要重新審視上市計劃，對SK海力士及現有股東是否最佳選擇，並強調暫停上市計劃，不會改變公司的增長前景及投資需要。</p><p></p><p>報道又提到韓國監管機構擔心，分拆計劃可能構成「雙重上市」，並稀釋現有股東權益。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.717227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:13.148447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:08.182372+00:00","content_hash":"73bb96813c695b00afc36c663e5691ab988b2ae2dbd27289584488e6486ee005","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.717227+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}